From f1a1049a4f0d650427b6e0e17fdd440cc7da4204 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 3 Jul 2026 00:41:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] fix(uc-compat): block non-recursive namespace drop when
 UC entities exist

Namespace emptiness checks only counted tabulars and child namespaces,
so dropping a schema silently cascade-deleted contained volumes,
functions and models. Count live UC entities in the drop guard; add
fork docs (docs/docs/uc-compat.md) and default the e2e unitycatalog-ai
executor to local mode (subprocess sandbox rlimits trip in CI
containers).
